# Treat these as binary: never apply end-of-line conversion, never try to diff
# them as text. Without this, Git on Windows warns about LF/CRLF on every PDF
# it touches, and a stray conversion would corrupt the file silently.
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gpkg  binary
*.parquet binary
*.pmtiles binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
